title: 'xcm-executor: trap leftover fees after failed surplus refunds'
doc:
  - audience: [Runtime Dev, Runtime User]
    description: |
      Preserve leftover fee assets during final XCM cleanup when a surplus-weight
      refund cannot fit into the holding register. These assets now reach the
      configured asset trap instead of being dropped with the executor.
      Leftover fees are trapped separately from holding to avoid enlarging
      an already-full trap receipt.
      Existing refund-overflow handling is unchanged. No API changes or storage
      migration are required.
crates:
  - name: staging-xcm-executor
    bump: patch
